  "reasoning": "The defendant, Yang, used his position as accountant and later director of a religious organization to illegally appropriate unit funds through repeated false reimbursements, amounting to 196,000 yuan, which constitutes the crime of embezzlement of public funds (职务侵占). Additionally, he misappropriated disaster relief donations (special earmarked funds) for personal and unrelated expenses, totaling 132,000 yuan, which fits the crime of misappropriation of designated funds (挪用特定款物). Both crimes are distinct and should be charged together.",
